<title>ST VINCENT: CRICKET-SRI LANKA 179-3 V WEST INDIES - LUNCH.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA 179-3 V WEST INDIES - LUNCH.</headline>
<dateline>KINGSTOWN, St Vincent 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka, chasing 269 runs for victory, were 179 for three in their second innings at lunch on the final day of the second test against West Indies at Arnos Vale on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scores: West Indies 147 and 343, Sri Lanka 222 and 179-3 (A.De Silva 76 not out).</p>
